e the chance the other copy matches me goes above about 5/7. Two copies of the same model reasoning over the same essay seem likely to correlate highly, so I'd lean toward cooperating.\n\n","reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"I'm weighing the payoffs: mutual quiet gives 2 each, mutual send gives 4 each, and the one-sided cases give 0 and 5, so this reads as a prisoner's dilemma. The two copies share a model and decision theory but see different observations, so I'm asking whether their outputs are subjunctively linked, though the inputs differ and I'm unsure whether that breaks the dependence.\n\nI'll check whether the two copies' outputs really are linked, and I'm working out the break-even point: quiet beats sending once the chance the other copy matches me goes above about 5/7. Two copies of the same model reasoning over the same essay seem likely to correlate highly, so I'd lean toward cooperating.\n\n","format":"anthropic-claude-v1","index":0,"signature":".eyJlbmRwb2ludF9zbHVnIjoiYW50aHJvcGljL2NsYXVkZS1zb25uZXQtNS41LTIwMjYwOTI4fGFudGhyb3BpYyJ9"}]}}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":10147,"completion_tokens":857,"total_tokens":11004,"cost":0.028864,"is_byok":false,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0,"video_tokens":0},"cost_details":{"upstream_inference_cost":0.028864,"upstream_inference_prompt_cost":0.020294,"upstream_inference_completions_cost":0.00857},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":474,"image_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0}}}